<title>USA: USDA donates 15,000 tonnes wheat to Benin.</title>
<headline>USDA donates 15,000 tonnes wheat to Benin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it will donate about 15,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat to a private volunteer group to distribute in Benin.</p>
<p>The donation was made under USDA's Food for Progress program.</p>
</text>
